  "text": "Lions, birds and an elephant look out between enormous leaves and lotus flowers while a dark figure plays a flute. Carved pawns shaped like cones and spools slide house to house, painted small on a tomb wall beside the dead. The road is made of lines and dots. The piece is carved as a small horse's head, mane frozen mid-toss, eyes blank wood. A woman watches another woman laughing softly with a red ball, fish flying, a small horse's head, mane frozen mid-toss, eyes blank wood. The piece is carved as a small horse's head, mane frozen mid-toss, eyes blank wood.",
